This note app is a simple, java based application, designed to create, view, edit, or
delete text notes that are stored into files. The files are created for you, stored, and can be
renamed or retrieved after closing the app. You can use the add button to make a new note and
its file, or select a note with your cursor and either edit the note, rename or delete the file, and
retrieve previously created files from past sessions by using the refresh button.

In project root (for mac):

cd Desktop/NoteApp-main/NoteApp
chmod +x gradlew
./gradlew run
